NOTEX="Z referenènim letom 2025 smo spremenili šifrant vrst prireditev, zato so podatki od leta 2025 objavljeni v novi tabeli. Kljub uvedbi novih kategorij vrst prireditev so podatki primerljivi s podatki v tabeli 1080711S.##Zbrani podatki so bili uteženi "
"zaradi manjkajoèih odgovorov (neodgovorov), skupni seštevki podatkov v tabelah se zaradi zaokroževanja decimalnih števil lahko minimalno razlikujejo od vsote posameznih podatkov.#";
NOTEX[en]="With reference year 2025, we revised the classification of types of performance; therefore, data from 2025 onwards are published in a new table. Despite the introduction of new categories of types of performance, the data remain comparable with "
"the data presented in table 1080711S.##The collected data were weighted due to missing responses (non-response).The totals in tables may slightly differ from individual data due to rounding of decimal places.#";
